1	/**
2	 * The `supported-matrix` flow: render the derived support matrix an operator is
3	 * allowed to quote, and refuse to print anything else.
4	 *
5	 * The matrix is not built here. It is read out of the published enterprise
6	 * report — the one `report:enterprise` re-derives from the canonical receipts —
7	 * and the trust package is verified before the file is read, so what reaches
8	 * stdout is the verified artifact rather than whatever happens to be on disk.
9	 *
10	 * The rendered text is then handed to the enterprise surface's own honesty
